    "body": "## Summary\n\n`tests/test_analysis_agent_utils.py` defined `_FUSION_HEADER` and `_FUSION_SEP`, which were exact copies of `_STANDALONE_HEADER` and `_SEP` in the same file. `_fusion_block` now uses the shared constants and the duplicates are removed.\n\nTest-only change, no behavior change.\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [x] `pytest tests/test_analysis_agent_utils.py`: 279 passed\n- [x] `black --check` and `ruff check --select F401,F841,RET502,RET503` clean\n",
    "changed_files": 1,
